6,Nkoroo,https://docs.verbix.com/EndangeredLanguages/Nkoroo,"Language family: Niger-Congo, Atlantic-Congo, Ijoid, Ijo, Eastern, Northeastern (SIL classification). Number of speakers: <5,000. Vulnerability: Threatened.A separate language within Ijo subgroup. Nkoroo is spoken in Nigeria, Africa.",Nkoroo,Niger-Congo
