8,Tribes In Rivers State: The Complete List | NaijaDetails,https://naijadetails.com/tribes-in-rivers-state/,"Other notable tribes are the Kalabari, Ekpeye, Ogba, Abua, Degema, Eleme, Opobo, Etche, Nkoro, Kula, Boma, Ibani (Bonny), Egeni, and Nkoroo. Each group has its customs and language. In total, about 30 different languages and dialects are spoken across the state.",Nkoroo,Niger-Congo
